---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Us | NutriBean+">
  <div class="page-container about-page">
    
    <!-- Tab di navigazione rapida in alto -->
    <nav class="author-tabs">
      <a href="#davide" class="author-tab-btn">Davide Lolla</a>
      <a href="#noemi" class="author-tab-btn">Noemi Marianna Pia</a>
      <a href="#pietro" class="author-tab-btn">Pietro Ciceri</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- INTRODUZIONE -->
    <div class="about-introduction">
      <p class="timeline-text">
      We are <strong>Davide Lolla, Noemi Marianna Pia, and Pietro Ciceri</strong>—three students who joined forces in 2023 at the age of 17, brought together by a shared passion for science, hands-on research, and curiosity. Studying in northern Italy—Davide at Guglielmo Marconi High School in Tortona, and Noemi and Pietro at I.S. Sobrero in Casale Monferrato—we turned a high school research idea into a real team effort. What started as a shared ambition quickly grew into a lasting friendship and took us all the way to national and international science fairs.
      </p>
    </div>
    <!-- ================= DAVIDE LOLLA ================= -->
    <section id="davide" class="author-section">
      <h2 class="author-main-title">Davide Lolla</h2>
      
      <div class="timeline-container">
        <!-- Anno 2023 -->
        <div class="timeline-row">
          <div class="timeline-left">
            <span class="timeline-year">2023</span>
            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <p class="timeline-text">
            I was a 4th-year student at Guglielmo Marconi High School in Tortona, living in a small village near Alessandria. Outside of school, I loved swimming, going to the gym, and watching all kinds of scientific documentaries to learn something new every time. Joining NutriBean+ with Noemi and Pietro was amazing because we all shared the exact same passions and ambitions—and it fueled my dream of working in the chemical field, perhaps as a biochemist or microbiology researcher.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-image">
            <img src="/davi-vecchia.jpg" alt="Davide Lolla 2023" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Anno 2026 -->
        <div class="timeline-row">
          <div class="timeline-left">
            <span class="timeline-year">2026</span>
            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <p class="timeline-text">

I have continued to nurture my passion for science by studying Chemistry at the University of Pavia, aiming to broaden my knowledge across every facet of the discipline. Alongside my academic path, I have never lost sight of my love for nature—cultivating a strong passion for mountaineering and hiking—and my desire to use scientific research to develop new, sustainable solutions for the environment. NutriBean+ was the starting point that turned this curiosity into a concrete goal.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-image">
            <img src="/davi-nuova.jpg" alt="Davide Lolla 2026" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="section-divider" />

    <!-- ================= NOEMI PIA ================= -->
    <section id="noemi" class="author-section">
      <h2 class="author-main-title">Noemi Marianna Pia</h2>
      

      <div class="timeline-container">
        <!-- Anno 2023 -->
        <div class="timeline-row">
          <div class="timeline-left">
            <span class="timeline-year">2023</span>
            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <p class="timeline-text">
            
I was a 17-year-old 4th-year student specializing in Chemistry at I.S. Sobrero technical high school in Casale Monferrato. I have always been fascinated by chemistry and its real-world applications, aiming for a future as a researcher or a teacher, alongside my love for art, traveling, photography, dance, and playing the saxophone. NutriBean+ gave me the chance to challenge myself, gain new knowledge, and work in a wonderful team toward a shared goal
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-image">
            <img src="/noemi-vecchia.JPG" alt="Noemi Pia 2023" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Anno 2026 -->
        <div class="timeline-row">
          <div class="timeline-left">
            <span class="timeline-year">2026</span>
            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <p class="timeline-text">
            I am a third-year undergraduate student in Chemistry and Chemical Technologies (specializing in Industrial Chemistry) at the University of Turin, planning to continue my studies in the field of environmental chemistry. Alongside my lab work and academic path, I have stayed deeply involved in science outreach and volunteering—from mentoring prospective students to volunteering at international science events—while keeping alive my love for art, dancing, and traveling. NutriBean+ was the spark that turned my curiosity into a real commitment to sustainability and green chemistry
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-image">
            <img src="/noemi-nuova.jpg" alt="Noemi Pia 2026" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="section-divider" />

    <!-- ================= PIETRO CICERI ================= -->
    <section id="pietro" class="author-section">
      <h2 class="author-main-title">Pietro Ciceri</h2>
     

      <div class="timeline-container">
        <!-- Anno 2023 -->
        <div class="timeline-row">
          <div class="timeline-left">
            <span class="timeline-year">2023</span>
            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <p class="timeline-text">
            
I was a 17-year-old Chinese-Italian student attending the 4th year of the International Applied Sciences track at I.S. Sobrero, dreaming of becoming an astrophysicist. Alongside my passion for science and math, I loved traveling, cooking, playing sports, and gaming. NutriBean+ was an incredible experience for me: it gave me the opportunity to do what I love most—research—while making great friends without whom this project wouldn't have been possible at all.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-image">
            <img src="/pietro-vecchia.jpg" alt="Pietro Ciceri 2023" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Anno 2026 -->
        <div class="timeline-row">
          <div class="timeline-left">
            <span class="timeline-year">2026</span>
            <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <p class="timeline-text">
            
I am continuing to pursue my passion for science as a joint undergraduate student in Mathematics and Physics at Harvard University. Alongside my coursework, I serve as a teaching assistant for a mathematics course and actively contribute to an academic research project. Outside the lab and classroom, I remain an avid traveler and have recently discovered a new passion for hiking. NutriBean+ was where my hands-on research journey truly began, giving me the foundation and curiosity I still carry with me today.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-image">
            <img src="/Pietro-nuova.png" alt="Pietro Ciceri 2026" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>
